"Arrival Station F, also called the Teleportation Complex, is F City's teleport travel center."
"A long hallway there is lined with phonebooth-sized teleportation bays."
"Each bay has an arched ceiling covered in spiraling symbols and a door like a blank metal wall."
"A female voice in each bay asks arrivals to submit to a scan or wait for an in-person check."
"Lit WAY OUT signs in five languages lead from the bays to a wide atrium of potted palms."
"The atrium help desk issues NesiCard debit cards after a thumbprint check."
"Post Drop #1301, a talking mailbox nicknamed Leo, is by the station's exit."
"Departures run in time slots, through a departures lounge and security scanners."
